    "sentence_translations": [
      "The Story of Mr. Li",
      "",
      "Mr. Li is a doctor. He works in a hospital.",
      "One day, he took a taxi to the hospital, and once he got in the car, he started giving his friend a phone call.",
      "He told his friend things about his children and work matters, and he was very happy.",
      "When they arrived at the hospital, he opened the door, got out of the car and said:",
      "“I have things to do tonight, and won’t come back home.”",
      "The driver said: “What? You didn’t give me the money.”",
      "Mr. Li said: “Oh, I’m sorry. I forgot I was in a taxi.",
      "I was under the impression that my wife was driving!”"
    ]
